# Reflex: the video, as a script.   ./rxctl script demo/video.rxs   (check first: --check)
# Dashboard in presentation mode beside the beam: http://<pi>:8080/?present  (or press P).
# Before recording: ./reflex-demo.sh start, then ./rxctl bench once, so the dashboard's
# "Is the AI worth having?" card shows numbers measured on THIS plant.
# Captions appear on the dashboard; "say" lines are cues for you in this terminal only.
# Part 2 (the second plant) is demo/video-joint.rxs.

# ---- pre-roll, not recorded
caption
train off
sp auto
guard on
wait-ai 20
say START RECORDING NOW
wait 3

# ---- 0:00 the hook: break the AI live, the ball survives; same fault without the guardian, it falls
caption An untrusted AI flies this machine. Watch what happens when it breaks.
inject flip
wait 5
clear
caption Same fault, guardian OFF:
guard off
inject flip
wait 5
clear
guard on
caption Reflex on QNX 8.0: every AI command is checked one step ahead
wait-ai 15

# ---- why have the AI at all
caption The fallback controller alone: safe, but slow
fallback on
wait 9
caption The AI pilot, same setpoints: faster (measured: see the card)
fallback off
wait 9

# ---- kill it, freeze it, feed it garbage
caption Kill the AI: the kernel tells the guardian that very tick
inject crash
wait 4
wait-ai 15
caption Freeze it: its deadline passes, the fallback flies
inject freeze
wait 4
clear
wait-ai 15
caption NaN on the wire: refused, the fallback flies
inject nan
wait 3
clear
wait-ai 15

# ---- the QNX part (terminal)
caption One MsgReceive gets the timer pulse and the AI's message: no locks, no timeouts
say TERMINAL: pidin -p reflex-pilot ; cat /dev/reflex   (about 20 s)
wait 20

# ---- who guards the guardian
caption Who guards the guardian? HAM restarts it from shared memory
say NOW: sudo slay -s KILL reflex-guardian   (HAM restarts it; the ball stays)
wait 10
caption If the computer goes silent, the I/O node levels the beam by itself
say NOW: pull the Black Pill's USB cable for 3 s, then plug it back in
wait 10
wait-ai 20
caption Next: the same guardian on a different machine
say NOW: ./reflex-demo.sh stop ; ./reflex-demo.sh start --plant joint ; ./rxctl script demo/video-joint.rxs
wait 3
caption
